# Butler Routes - Zephras Isle completionist pilot (pack butler-routes-completionist, v0.1.2).
# Every Zephras Isle quest in the WoW Forever command center's tracker list
# (145 quests, incl. the three spawn quests 92460-92462 restored 2026-11-13)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin.
# Class and order (faction) quests for other classes/orders are included and
# gated with 'only', so they never show for a character they are not for.
# Same-name order pairs (Welcome to Shen'dar Village, To Valanaar, In Service
# of Zephras, A Grand Adventure, What Comes Next, The Fate of Zephras,
# Confront Lorthuna) are co-located: take the version your order offers.
# Coordinates typed in this guide are in the client's own (live) map frame.
# Kill/collect/interact objectives ride objective-level lines (npc/item id +
# quest.objective ref + dumped coords); generic complete pins remain only
# for event-style objectives with no kill/collect target.
guide butler-routes-completionist/zephras-isle
title Zephras Isle - Completionist (Skyborne)
levels 1-12
zone Zephras Isle
race Skyborne
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords zephras, completionist, skyborne, all quests, orinis
coords live
version 5

step Thendal Village - arrival

  tip You appear in Thendal Village. Ailee Farheart (42.8, 23.4) stands beside you with the first quest every Skyborne takes; it leads you to Rorian the Dayseeker (42.1, 23.5), who runs the village. Take every quest a person offers before you head out.
  note If a golden vuldren crosses your path anywhere on Zephras Isle, that is Slydris, the rare golden fox. Tame him if you are a hunter of level 10 or more. Foxes cannot learn Growl yet, so he is a trophy for the stable, not a tank.
  accept 92460 -- Ailee Farheart - Coming of Age
  turnin 92460 -- Hand it to Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92461 -- Rorian the Dayseeker - Harmony in Balance (slay 8 Juvenile Vuldren, south of the village)
  kill 250873 quest 92461.1 @42.6,23.6 live -- Juvenile Vuldren, south of the village
  accept 92464 -- Rorian the Dayseeker - Elemental Unrest
  accept 92462 -- Elatrell Featherlight (43.4, 24.8) - Infestation Investigation (slay 8 Pesky Cirrusflies, alongside the Queen)
  kill 251169 quest 92462.1 @43.3,25.2 live -- the cirrusflies around the grove
  accept 94414 -- Halaan Hawk-Eye (43.8, 24.1) - The Anchors of Zephras
  complete 94414 @43.8,24.1 live -- Listen to Halaan; that is the whole quest
  accept 92474 -- Myriaal Mistwake (43.7, 24.1) - Falling With Style

step Thendal Village - your class introduction

  tip Hand Harmony in Balance to Rorian; at level 2 he gives every class its first lesson. Only your own class's quest is offered to you; the other lines simply never appear.
  turnin 92461 -- Harmony in Balance - back to Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92481 only Mage -- A Student of the Arcane - Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92482 only Hunter -- The Way of the Hunter - Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92483 only Rogue -- At Home in the Shadows - Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92484 only Shaman,Horde -- Embracing the Elements - Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92485 only Druid -- A Student of Nature - Rorian the Dayseeker
  accept 92532 only Warrior -- The Warrior's Path - Rorian the Dayseeker
  turnin 92481 only Mage
  turnin 92482 only Hunter
  turnin 92483 only Rogue
  turnin 92484 only Shaman,Horde
  turnin 92485 only Druid
  turnin 92532 only Warrior

step Yala Windwatcher

  tip Yala Windwatcher stands east of the village at 47.3, 21.9. Elemental Unrest is handed in to her, and she has the follow-up work: converts north of her, roiling winds past them.
  turnin 92464 -- Hand Elemental Unrest to Yala Windwatcher
  accept 92465 -- Agitators - Yala Windwatcher
  kill 251160 quest 92465.1 @46.5,21.5 live -- Al'Aketh Converts, north of Yala
  kill 251143 quest 92465.2 @46.2,21.8 live -- Roiling Winds, past the converts
  turnin 92465 -- Agitators - back to Yala Windwatcher

step Thendal Grove - the grove work

  tip Work the grove quests, then hand in as you pass each giver. The Queen's own step comes next - a second trip out to the grove.
  turnin 92462 -- Infestation Investigation - back to Elatrell Featherlight
  accept 92463 -- Elatrell Featherlight - The Cirrusfly Queen (needs 92462 turned in first - take its warning if it is not done)
  turnin 94414 -- The Anchors of Zephras - back to Halaan Hawk-Eye
  turnin 92474 -- Falling With Style - back to Rorian the Dayseeker

step Thendal Grove - the Cirrusfly Queen

  tip Back out to the meadow east of the grove: the Queen hovers over it on the Yala road. Kill her, then hand in on the next grove pass.
  kill 251404 quest 92463.1 @48.4,28.5 live -- the Cirrusfly Queen, east meadow

step Word for Rorian

  tip Yala's word goes to Rorian in the grove; Elatrell is on the way through - hand her the Queen as you pass.
  turnin 92463 -- The Cirrusfly Queen - back to Elatrell Featherlight
  accept 92469 -- Yala Windwatcher (47.3, 21.9) sends word to Rorian
  turnin 92469 -- Return to Rorian - bring word of the Al'Aketh to Rorian
  accept 92471 -- Aetheen of the Gales - Rorian sends you on
  turnin 92471 -- Speak with Aetheen of the Gales (42.7, 23.6)

step Thendal Grove - around the grove

  tip The last Thendal errands, all in or near the grove. The ley line and skysight quests belong to opposite orders: only your own is offered. Take the den pair's accepts here too - the dens work rides the outing below.
