step Thendal Grove - the dens outing

  tip South-west to the ursera dens for the pair's field work: claws off the scrawny ursera in the woods, then scavengers and Urs'anah herself at the back of the den. One trip, both quests, then hand in together below.
  collect 251918 quest 92473.1 @35.6,23.9 live -- Scrawny Ursera Claws, in the woods by the dens
  kill 250937 quest 92470.1 @35.6,24.3 live -- Ursera Scavengers, through the den
  collect 252665 quest 92470.2 @35.7,26.1 live -- the Head of Urs'anah, at the back of the den

step Thendal Grove - the den mother

  tip Aetheen of the Gales takes the den work together. Foul Matriarch and The Next Step both run through her, and she starts The Adventurer for the Shen'dar camp.
  level 5
  turnin 92473 -- Aggressive Encroachment - Valreaa Valewind's word stays in the grove
  turnin 92470 -- Foul Matriarch - back to Aetheen of the Gales
  accept 92472 -- The Next Step - Aetheen of the Gales
  accept 96638 -- The Adventurer - Aetheen of the Gales sends you to Raan Wildwind at the Shen'dar camp

