step The road south

  tip On the road south to Shen'dar Village, Hanaa Nightwind (38.4, 30.1) has work: Al'Aketh cultists infest the ruins to the south-west.
  accept 92544 -- Al'Aketh Thugs - Hanaa Nightwind
  kill 251145 quest 92544.1 @35.4,33.6 live -- Al'Aketh Brutes, in the south-west ruins
  kill 251448 quest 92544.2 @35.3,33.4 live -- Al'Aketh Neophytes, in the south-west ruins
  kill 256935 quest 92544.3 @36.1,33.5 live -- Malduko Cloudcrush holds the ruins' middle
  turnin 92544
step Shen'dar Village - arrival

  tip Report to Constable Aonda (45.6, 45.5). Make the inn your home while you are here: innkeeper Coriella Calmbreeze stands at 43.0, 43.3.
  turnin 92472 -- The Next Step - report to Constable Aonda
  accept 92514 only Horde -- Welcome to Shen'dar Village - one of the two versions is your order's; take the one Aonda offers
  accept 93461 only Alliance -- Welcome to Shen'dar Village - the other order's version; it will not be offered to you

step Shen'dar Village - a gatherer's toolkit

  tip Shen'dar holds the island's profession trainers. Messana Crestwind (44.8, 44.5) teaches Mining; Halassa Fernbreeze (43.0, 43.5) teaches Herbalism. These two lines are the reason this pack exists - a gatherer's route. They are optional: skip them if gathering is not your plan.
  train Mining optional
  train Herbalism optional

step Shen'dar Village - the two orders

  tip Each order sends you against the other's students in the Highlands. Only your own order's quests are offered. The apprentices' and seers' work rides the Highlands sweep below - take the quests here, do them there.
  turnin 92514 only Horde -- Welcome to Shen'dar Village - speak with your order's envoy and Coriella Calmbreeze
  turnin 93461 only Alliance -- Welcome to Shen'dar Village - the other order's version ends the same way
  accept 92596 only Alliance -- The High Order - Rathiril Sunlance (46.4, 46.4)
  accept 92595 only Horde -- The Windshapers - Illaya Amberwind (43.5, 44.8)
  turnin 92596 only Alliance
  turnin 92595 only Horde
  accept 94413 only Alliance -- A Magical Affront - Rathiril Sunlance
  accept 94411 only Horde -- Meddlesome Mages - Illaya Amberwind
  accept 92517 -- The Criminal Element - Constable Aonda
  note The apprentices' and seers' work rides the Highlands sweep below - hand in with its returns.

