step Shen'dar Village - Aonda's errands

  tip Aonda's errands: infiltrate the cult, carry Sania's word to Falaath, and check the bounty board. Vulgara's head waits for the highlands trio sweep below - take the bounty here, do it there.
  accept 93036 -- Infiltrating the Cult - Constable Aonda
