step Valanaar - first errands

  tip Aamelia Windfield's orchard lies west along the shore; Nyalah Brightfire stays in the city. Take both errands, work the shore, and hand the crab meat in with the orchard's returns.
  accept 92679 -- Blood Tithe - Alvarion Windfield (62.1, 73.3); it leads to the Windfield Orchard
  accept 93317 -- Crab Season - Nyalah Brightfire (60.7, 72.7)
  collect 257941 quest 93317.1 @44.1,74.5 live -- the windsong crawlers along the shore

step Windfield Orchard

  tip Aamelia Windfield's orchard, in the Gustberry Lowlands. Bandits, flutterflies and galestriders - and keep an eye out for a certain rare tallstrider.
